      "priority": "high",
      "rationale": "Document Date (DTM+137) is MANDATORY in EANCOM INVOIC. The ontology has 'hasInvoiceDate' as a string property, which loses the EDIFACT segment structure and cannot distinguish between Document Date, Delivery Date, Tax Point Date, etc. Each qualifier creates a semantically", "owl_reviewed_length": 17894, "consultation_logged": true, "audits_remaining": 1}

